{"time": 1756218815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1202316227", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057832383", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "*直接追上抓住空中的钱"}
{"time": 1756218858, "type": "recv", "message_id": "588642265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057832383", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...不过安安和小黑前来，也有御主的安排...\"看着小黑抓住钱，没说什么，\"唔...罗小黑姐姐。\""}
{"time": 1756218867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1930210457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057832383", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我们可以一起去见一见监管者吗？\""}
